Case also greets or thanks them by name in roll calls and wrap-ups, including 2023-12-08, 2024-04-02, 2024-07-20, 2024-09-25 (DJ Newsic’s outro: “Giggle Trash, thanks for hanging out”), 2024-12-23, 2025-02-25, 2026-02-12, 2026-04-11 (“Card King, Giggles…”), 2026-04-15, 2026-05-26, 2026-07-24, 2026-08-04 and 2026-09-25. On 2026-11-07, newly installed mayor Crum greets them: “Giggle Trash. Great to see you. I’m going to be building all stream long, rebuilding Rennerton in ways that Munch could only dream of.” Most of their other mentions are bit and sub thank-yous worked into Hype Train freestyles.
